    "title": "UVA Health launches first robotic heart surgery program in Virginia - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Aila Miyabi ,\n6 hours ago CHARLOTTESVILLE, Va. (WVIR) - Cardiac patients at UVA Health could see smaller incisions and shorter recovery times for future surgeries, with UVA Health launching Virginia’s first robotic heart surgery program. Dr. Michael E. Ibrahim is a cardiac surgeon and director of Virginia’s only dedicated robotic cardiac surgery program. Read full article\n4",
